    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The shares were sold to the Issuer pursuant to a Stock Repurchase Agreement, dated November 6, 2026, between the Reporting Person (and certain trusts of which the Reporting Person is a trustee) and the Issuer (the &quot;Stock Repurchase Agreement&quot;). Under the Stock Repurchase Agreement, the Issuer agreed to purchase an aggregate of 800,000 shares of common stock at a price of $41.80 per share. The Reporting Person sold 250,000 shares held directly and 550,000 shares held indirectly through trusts of which the Reporting Person is the trustee.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The dispositions reported herein were approved in advance by the Audit Committee of the Issuer's Board of Directors, which consists solely of two or more Non-Employee Directors (as defined in Rule 16b-3), for purposes of exempting the transactions from Section 16(b) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended, pursuant to Rule 16b-3(e) thereunder.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">305,000 shares were sold from The Rocco A. Ortenzio Separate Descendants Trust FBO Robert Ortenzio at $41.80 per share for aggregate proceeds of $12,749,000. The Reporting Person is the trustee of this trust and may be deemed to have voting and investment power over the shares held therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">150,000 shares were sold from The Robert A. Ortenzio Descendants Trust at $41.80 per share for aggregate proceeds of $6,270,000. The Reporting Person is the trustee of this trust and may be deemed to have voting and investment power over the shares held therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">35,000 shares were sold from the Robert A. Ortenzio 2014 Trust for Bryan A. Ortenzio at $41.80 per share for aggregate proceeds of $1,463,000. The Reporting Person is the trustee of this trust and may be deemed to have voting and investment power over the shares held therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">35,000 shares were sold from the Robert A. Ortenzio 2014 Trust for Kevin M. Ortenzio at $41.80 per share for aggregate proceeds of $1,463,000. The Reporting Person is the trustee of this trust and may be deemed to have voting and investment power over the shares held therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">25,000 shares were sold from the Robert A. Ortenzio 2014 Trust for Madeline G. Ortenzio at $41.80 per share for aggregate proceeds of $1,045,000. The Reporting Person is the trustee of this trust and may be deemed to have voting and investment power over the shares held therein.</footnote>
